1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,380
Just the constant discovery and reworking and going back in and figure out what recipe is going to work because we want to feel good about the art that we put out.

2
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:10,400
However, we do want it to connect.

3
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:13,100
It's that fine line, that balance.

4
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:15,780
I found it after nine projects.

5
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:20,540
I put out nine projects and the ninth one stuck.

6
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:21,640
That was the one.

7
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:22,620
And which one was that?

8
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:23,760
That was the self-titled.

